    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Aug 2025 18:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你是否感觉30岁这个数字像一道分水岭，仿佛过了这个年龄就必须拥有房子、稳定的婚姻和令人羡慕的事业？当周围的声音不断提醒你"该怎样"的时候，内心的迷茫和焦虑是否让你夜不能寐？这期节目里，我们三位主播将分享各自真实的30岁体验与思考，一起探讨30岁不是终点，而是一个充满可能性的人生新起点。毕竟，人生是自己的，30岁的意义也该由你自己定义～</span></p><span></span><p><span>🧭收听指南</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.lizhi.fm/voice/3160087085313321990?band=294046624#" data-url="https://www.lizhi.fm/voice/3160087085313321990?band=294046624#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a></span></a><span> 30岁焦虑：难道只有我一个人在思考未来？</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.lizhi.fm/voice/3160087085313321990?band=294046624#" data-url="https://www.lizhi.fm/voice/3160087085313321990?band=294046624#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a></span></a><span> 为北京户口放弃腾讯高薪offer，值吗？</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.lizhi.fm/voice/3160087085313321990?band=294046624#" data-url="https://www.lizhi.fm/voice/3160087085313321990?band=294046624#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="777">12:57</a></span></a><span> 28岁买房亏80万！30岁焦虑的代价有多大？</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.lizhi.fm/voice/3160087085313321990?band=294046624#" data-url="https://www.lizhi.fm/voice/3160087085313321990?band=294046624#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="908">15:08</a></span></a><span> 临近30岁的就业焦虑和预见35岁危机</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.lizhi.fm/voice/3160087085313321990?band=294046624#" data-url="https://www.lizhi.fm/voice/3160087085313321990?band=294046624#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a></span></a><span> 超一线城市打拼者：30岁该冒险还是求稳？</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.lizhi.fm/voice/3160087085313321990?band=294046624#" data-url="https://www.lizhi.fm/voice/3160087085313321990?band=294046624#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2067">34:27</a></span></a><span> 失败也是一种人生体验</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.lizhi.fm/voice/3160087085313321990?band=294046624#" data-url="https://www.lizhi.fm/voice/3160087085313321